### Automation API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Create New Automation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/automation
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Welcome Message Automation",
  "description": "Automatically send welcome message to new followers",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "new_follower",
    "platform": "instagram"
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "send_message",
      "message": "Thank you for following! Welcome to our community 🎉",
      "delay": 300
    }
  ],
  "isActive": true
}

### 2. Get All Automations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/automation
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get Specific Automation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Update Automation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Updated Welcome Message",
  "description": "Updated automation description",
  "isActive": false
}

### 5. Delete Automation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Start Automation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here/start
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Stop Automation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Get Automation Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Test Automation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here/test
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "testData": {
    "userId": "test_user_id",
    "platform": "instagram"
  }
}

### 10. Get Automation Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/automation/automation_id_here/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}